.TH INGEST "1" "2026\-05\-17" "anythingllm\-feeder 0.1.8" "Generated Python Manual"
.SH NAME
ingest \- Upload forage's extracted Markdown into a local AnythingLLM instance, one workspace per collection.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ingest
[-h] [--version] [-v] [-q] [--json] [--url URL] [--api-key API_KEY] [--api-key-file API_KEY_FILE] [--storage-dir STORAGE_DIR] [--http-timeout HTTP_TIMEOUT] [--print-completion {bash,zsh,tcsh}] {sync,status,list,check,reset,purge} ...

.SH
POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS
.SS \fBingest sync\fR
upload changed forage documents to AnythingLLM

usage: ingest sync [\-h] [\-\-all] [\-\-include\-suspicious] [\-\-keep\-orphans]
                   [\-\-dry\-run] [\-v] [\-q] [\-\-json] [\-\-url URL]
                   [\-\-api\-key API_KEY] [\-\-api\-key\-file API_KEY_FILE]
                   [\-\-storage\-dir STORAGE_DIR] [\-\-http\-timeout HTTP_TIMEOUT]
                   [name]

arguments:
.RS 7
.TP
\fBname\fR
collection name (omit with \-\-all)
.RE


options:
.RS 7
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-include\-suspicious\fR
also upload forage rows with status=suspicious

.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-orphans\fR
do not delete documents from AnythingLLM that forage no longer lists

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR

.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
machine\-readable JSON output where applicable

.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI\,URL\/\fR
AnythingLLM base URL (overrides ANYTHINGLLM_URL and config.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\fR \fI\,API_KEY\/\fR
AnythingLLM API key (overrides ANYTHINGLLM_API_KEY). Visible in shell history
and `ps`; prefer \-\-api\-key\-file or the env var for sensitive uses.

.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\-file\fR \fI\,API_KEY_FILE\/\fR
read the API key from this file (one line, trimmed)

.TP
\fB\-\-storage\-dir\fR \fI\,STORAGE_DIR\/\fR
AnythingLLM storage directory for the disk\-usage report (overrides
ANYTHINGLLM_STORAGE_DIR and config.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-http\-timeout\fR \fI\,HTTP_TIMEOUT\/\fR
read/write timeout in seconds for AnythingLLM HTTP calls (overrides
INGEST_HTTP_TIMEOUT; default 300). Connect timeout is fixed at 5 s.
.RE

